[[3,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a lift.</p><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>Raise the car.</p><p>1. Undo the retaining bolt.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection (2a) and remove the rpm\nsensor (2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Rpm sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>K46</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046943.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the rpm sensor in its seating and tighten\nthe fixing bolt.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Rpm sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>K46</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Lower the vehicle.</p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"]]